        "reference": "Helaman 3:7",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that they did multiply and spread, and did go forth from the land southward to the land northward, and did spread insomuch that they began to cover the face of the whole earth, from the sea south to the sea north, from the sea west to the sea east.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 243,
            "end": 246,
            "text": "Alma 22:27 (27, 32–33); Hel. 11:20."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 3:8",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And the people who were in the land northward did dwell in tents, and in houses of cement, and they did suffer whatsoever tree should spring up upon the face of the land that it should grow up, that in time they might have timber to build their houses, yea, their cities, and their temples, and their synagogues, and their sanctuaries, and all manner of their buildings.",
