        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "And now I return again to mine account; therefore, what I have spoken had passed after there had been great contentions, and disturbances, and wars, and dissensions, among the people of Nephi.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
